END_DATE             01/01/1998
END_TIME             18:00:00
SWEEP_START          01/01
SWEEP_END            12/31
DRY_DAYS             5
REPORT_STEP          00:05:00
WET_STEP             00:01:00
DRY_STEP             00:05:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:05
